# Fastest measured t2v: QAD-v2 NVFP4 linears + all-8-bit attention (E4M3 QK^T and PV) on the fused path.
# Measured 2026-11-07, production: 7.71 s per clip; teacher-forced error vs the BF16 V2 teacher 0.284 / 0.167 (QAD with BF16
# attention: 0.273 / 0.156). E4M3 QK^T is the lossy part (2-5% per head on captured layers; the GB300 has no INT8 MMA).
#   docker compose --env-file profiles/max.env up -d t2v
FV_ARGS=--generator.model_path /root/.cache/huggingface/composed/fasth3-qad-v2-fullvae --generator.engine.compile.vae_enabled true --generator.engine.quantization.transformer_quant NVFP4 --generator.engine.quantization.layer_profile h3_dit_vsa
FASTVIDEO_H3_FP8_ATTN=1
